  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The currently trending world Super Fun Obby by Hans has a system where upon respawn you will be served a full screen pop up for microtransaction purchases. I believe a lot of VRC players especially VR users would appreciate an option to disable this kind of \"intrusive pop-ups\"(blocking movement and most vision, requires the user to click \"X\" to close popup). \n\nI would like to suggest these possible solutions:\n\n1. Options to disable all \"Automatic pop-up\" or just popups.\n\n2. Allow user movement to dismiss pop-ups.\n\n3. Allow VRC menu button to dismiss pop-ups. \n\n4. Only allow intrusive pop-ups if a user has actively clicked on an element.\n\nI may be in the minority here since that world mentioned above is trending with hundreds of players. But as a VR user needing to dismiss a pop-up by clicking a tiny \"x\" button every few seconds is extremely irritating.",
